{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"一、元年。春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"二、楚子、陳侯、隨侯、許男圍蔡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"三、鼷鼠食郊牛，改卜牛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"四、夏四月辛巳，郊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊侯、衞侯伐晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_228_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_228","textTraditional":"六、冬，仲孫何忌帥師伐邾婁。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}